{"game": "deep-rock-galactic", "language": "schinese", "appid": 548430, "month": "2019-02", "window": 3, "start_date": 1550275200, "end_date": 1550966399, "month_true_total": 62, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-08-29 21:52:08 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "49182473", "author": {"steamid": "76561198255679191", "personaname": "tsundoku", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198255679191/", "num_games_owned": 289, "num_reviews": 14, "playtime_forever": 94938, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2602, "last_played": 1762360796, "avatar": "22b73010b0abc6eb07f47f4e479d3b749438425b"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "四个职业各有分工，与小伙伴开黑才是这个游戏的乐趣所在。诚然游戏后期可玩性较少，皮肤饰品模组也比较肝，更期待游戏开发者的一次次更新。", "timestamp_created": 1550918196, "timestamp_updated": 1585199041, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 5, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.598540186882019043", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "49173951", "author": {"steamid": "76561198099095734", "personaname": "yangchenzxm", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198099095734/", "num_games_owned": 56, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 11808, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2603, "last_played": 1762614992, "avatar": "fef49e7fa7e1997310d705b2a6158ff8dc1cdfeb"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "优点：\n1、采矿、杀虫子，喝酒，简直爽到爆（进去之后记得连喝三杯刁虫射手特别舒服，加伤害buff，真的）\n2、开放度高，侦察兵在空中飞来飞去有种武林高手的感觉，我超喜欢的\n3、游戏里的老哥们虽然说话不多，但一个个超有爱，千里迢迢赶来救我\n缺点：\n1、玩法比较单一，目前只有采集，修复，歼灭三种模式（我没记错吧）。反正就是给你一个理由去杀虫子，杀一段时间就比较无聊\n2、新玩家可能不知道救援规则  没等到队友救援就退了，建议后期加点提示\n3、高空坠落真的很烦。有些地方看上去可以站，但是有时候却回掉下去\n对新玩家的建议：\n救人的时候小心点，我上面有虫", "timestamp_created": 1550902376, "timestamp_updated": 1550902376, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "49151716", "author": {"steamid": "76561198376827602", "personaname": "张炫忠", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198376827602/", "num_games_owned": 349, "num_reviews": 38, "playtime_forever": 19653, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 5102, "last_played": 1748103727, "avatar": "0de985fbb308114f7a820a619822ad8e606b78a6"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "好游戏值得入手。如果你是线上多人合作游戏爱好者，买就完事了。和同类游戏相比，本游戏的特色是：\n1. 游戏模式丰富，各种任务类型多样化且不重复，不容易腻（相比于杀地板2只有一种模式）\n2. 有一定的RPG元素，但不至于太肝。没有某些肝帝游戏那样的浮躁的网游习气\n3. 游戏环境好，大家相处的都很欢乐。没有PVP，没有无止境的刷刷刷，没有攀比心，大家的心态都很好，就算翻车了也不过哈哈一笑，而不是相互指责，这才是合作游戏该有的样子嘛。\n4. 游戏的地形探索系统很有趣，这也是本游戏的核心玩法之一。游戏的地形往往非常复杂，需要合理利用钻洞，搭平台，挂滑索等方式辅助队友机动。这点是大多数合作游戏不具备的。\n现在本游戏还处于EA阶段，希望制作组以后能推出更多武器，更多敌人，以及更多游戏模式。另外把网络优化下，有时候pin高了导致平台上不去，掉下去摔死很郁闷。", "timestamp_created": 1550825994, "timestamp_updated": 1582949851, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "49145919", "author": {"steamid": "76561198320518096", "personaname": "EDF·ストームワン", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/861453373/", "num_games_owned": 339, "num_reviews": 155, "playtime_forever": 25063, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 4709, "last_played": 1720536041, "avatar": "cb3985fc749c18eac6a8bdc26c7d47781b7784b5"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "MUSHROOM", "timestamp_created": 1550790228, "timestamp_updated": 1688238342, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "49100247", "author": {"steamid": "76561198416160569", "personaname": "pary", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198416160569/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 6490, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 665, "last_played": 1677682906, "avatar": "fef49e7fa7e1997310d705b2a6158ff8dc1cdfeb"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "不错，就是人比较少啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊", "timestamp_created": 1550582032, "timestamp_updated": 1550582032, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 1, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}]}